#: ../../index.rst:3
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门"

#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "介绍"

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Welcome to the |prodname| Windows Client User Guide. This guide describes"
" client functionality for users in |prodname|."
msgstr "欢迎使用 |prodname| Windows 客户端用户指南。本指南描述了 |prodname| 用户的客户端功能。"

#: ../../index.rst:11
msgid "Client Agents"
msgstr "客户端代理"

#: ../../index.rst:13
msgid ""
"|prodname| client agents are available for Windows, Mac, iOS, Android, "
"and Windows phones. These clients are designed to work with your "
"|prodname| account which can be powered by any supported storage service."
msgstr "|prodname| 客户端代理可用于 Windows、Mac、iOS、Android 和 Windows 手机。这些客户端旨在与您的 |prodname| 账户配合使用，该账户可以由任何支持的存储服务提供动力。"

#: ../../index.rst:16
msgid "Windows Client Agent"
msgstr "Windows 客户端代理"

#: ../../index.rst:19
msgid "System Requirement"
msgstr "系统要求"

#: ../../index.rst:21
msgid "OS - Windows XP, Vista, 7/8/8.1/10"
msgstr "操作系统 - Windows XP、Vista、7/8/8.1/10"

#: ../../index.rst:22
msgid ""
"Normally on Windows Server type machine such as 2025/2022/2019, use "
"server agent instead of client agent. However, the client agent can run "
"as desktop application on Windows Server OS as well.  For example, if you"
" plan to have the desktop agent run in a terminal server environment, you"
" need to install desktop agent instead of server agent."
msgstr "通常在如2025/2022/2019这类Windows服务器类型的机器上，使用服务器代理而不是客户端代理。然而，客户端代理也可以作为桌面应用程序在Windows Server操作系统上运行。例如，如果您计划在终端服务器环境中运行桌面代理，您需要安装桌面代理而不是服务器代理。"

#: ../../index.rst:24
msgid "Hard Drive - 100MB"
msgstr "硬盘驱动器 - 100MB"

#: ../../index.rst:24
msgid "50MB for the installed program"
msgstr "安装程序需要50MB"

#: ../../index.rst:25
msgid "at least 50MB for the operation of cache folder"
msgstr "操作缓存文件夹至少需要50MB"

#: ../../index.rst:26
msgid "CPU - No specific requirement (Intel/AMD x86/x64)"
msgstr "CPU - 无特定要求（Intel/AMD x86/x64）"

#: ../../index.rst:27
msgid "Internet Connection"
msgstr "互联网连接"

#: ../../index.rst:31
msgid "This guide is written against Windows Client agent version |release|"
msgstr "本指南是根据Windows客户端代理版本 |release| 编写的"

